        "delta": "retune the chunked-scan granularity (chunk size bt): larger amortizes per-chunk dispatch and cuts the number of serial recurrence steps, smaller fits on-chip; regenerate the chunk-constant matrices and re-tile to match. Applies only to kernels with a chunked scan / loop over a bt constant; N/A to kernels without chunking",
